[2026-03-14T19:48:51.930Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016uAapQQrikssR7CEMgyJW9","type":"tool_result","content":"419:- FilterSidebar\n420-- FlightResultCard\n421-- TrackPricesToggle\n422-- Pagination\n423-\n424-### SearchSummaryBar\n425-\n426-#### Test: SearchSummaryBar displays search parameters after search\n427-- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n428-- **Initial state**: User searched LAX → JFK, Mar 25 – Apr 1, 1 adult, Economy, Round trip\n429-- **Action**: User observes the summary bar at the top of the results page\n--\n480:### FilterSidebar\n481-\n482:#### Test: FilterSidebar displays all filter sections\n483:- **Components**: FilterSidebar\n484-- **Initial state**: Search results page loaded with results\n485-- **Action**: User observes the left sidebar\n486-- **Expected**: The sidebar displays filter sections: Stops, Airlines, Price range, Duration range, Departure time, and a Sort by dropdown. All sections are visible and labeled.\n487-\n488:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — check Nonstop\n489:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n490-- **Initial state**: Results page with mix of nonstop and connecting flights\n491-- **Action**: User checks the \"Nonstop\" checkbox in the Stops filter\n492-- **Expected**: Only nonstop flights are displayed in the results list. Flights with 1+ stops are hidden.\n493-\n494:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — check 1 stop\n495:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n496-- **Initial state**: Results page with mix of nonstop and connecting flights, no filters applied\n497-- **Action**: User checks the \"1 stop\" checkbox\n498-- **Expected**: Only 1-stop flights are displayed. Nonstop and 2+ stop flights are hidden.\n499-\n500:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — check multiple options\n501:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n502-- **Initial state**: Results page with various flights\n503-- **Action**: User checks both \"Nonstop\" and \"1 stop\" checkboxes\n504-- **Expected**: Both nonstop and 1-stop flights are displayed. Only 2+ stop flights are hidden.\n505-\n506:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — uncheck to remove filter\n507:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n508-- **Initial state**: \"Nonstop\" checkbox is checked, only nonstop flights shown\n509-- **Action**: User unchecks \"Nonstop\"\n510-- **Expected**: All flights are displayed again (no stops filter active).\n511-\n512:#### Test: FilterSidebar airlines filter shows airlines with flight counts\n513:- **Components**: FilterSidebar\n514-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded with results from multiple airlines\n515-- **Action**: User observes the Airlines filter section\n516-- **Expected**: A list of airline names is shown, each with a checkbox and a count of how many flights that airline has in the results (e.g., \"Delta (12)\", \"United (8)\").\n517-\n518:#### Test: FilterSidebar airlines filter — select specific airline\n519:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n520-- **Initial state**: Results with flights from Delta, United, and American\n521-- **Action**: User checks the \"Delta\" checkbox in the Airlines filter\n522-- **Expected**: Only Delta flights are shown in results. United and American flights are hidden.\n523-\n524:#### Test: FilterSidebar airlines filter — select multiple airlines\n525:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n526-- **Initial state**: Results with flights from multiple airlines\n527-- **Action**: User checks \"Delta\" and \"United\"\n528-- **Expected**: Only Delta and United flights are shown. Other airline flights are hidden.\n529-\n530:#### Test: FilterSidebar price range slider displays histogram\n531:- **Components**: FilterSidebar\n532-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded\n533-- **Action**: User observes the Price range filter section\n534-- **Expected**: A price range slider is displayed with min and max handles. Above or within the slider, a histogram shows the distribution of prices across the results. The min and max price labels are shown.\n535-\n536:#### Test: FilterSidebar price range slider filters results\n537:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n538-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights ranging from $150 to $800\n539-- **Action**: User drags the max price handle to $400\n540-- **Expected**: Only flights priced at $400 or below are displayed. Flights above $400 are hidden. The slider shows the updated max value.\n541-\n542:#### Test: FilterSidebar price range slider — adjust min price\n543:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n544-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights ranging from $150 to $800\n545-- **Action**: User drags the min price handle to $300\n546-- **Expected**: Only flights priced at $300 or above are displayed. Flights below $300 are hidden.\n547-\n548:#### Test: FilterSidebar duration range slider filters results\n549:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n550-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights of various durations\n551-- **Action**: User adjusts the duration slider to max 6 hours\n552-- **Expected**: Only flights with duration of 6 hours or less are displayed. Longer flights are hidden.\n553-\n554:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — Morning checkbox\n555:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n556-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various times\n557-- **Action**: User checks \"Morning\" in the Departure time filter\n558-- **Expected**: Only flights departing in the morning time window are displayed.\n559-\n560:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — multiple time periods\n561:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n562-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various times\n563-- **Action**: User checks \"Morning\" and \"Evening\"\n564-- **Expected**: Flights departing in either morning or evening time windows are displayed. Afternoon and night flights are hidden.\n565-\n566:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — arrival time checkboxes\n567:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n568-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded\n569-- **Action**: User checks \"Afternoon\" in the arrival time checkbox group\n570-- **Expected**: Only flights arriving in the afternoon are displayed.\n571-\n572:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by dropdown — default \"Best\"\n573:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n574-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded, no sort selection made\n575-- **Action**: User observes the Sort by dropdown\n576-- **Expected**: The dropdown shows \"Best\" as the default selected sort option.\n577-\n578:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Price (lowest)\n579:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n580-- **Initial state**: Results page with multiple flights at different prices\n581-- **Action**: User selects \"Price (lowest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n582-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the cheapest flight first. Prices increase going down the list.\n583-\n584:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Duration (shortest)\n585:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n586-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights of various durations\n587-- **Action**: User selects \"Duration (shortest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n588-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the shortest flight first. Durations increase going down the list.\n589-\n590:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Departure time (earliest)\n591:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n592-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various departure times\n593-- **Action**: User selects \"Departure time (earliest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n594-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the earliest departure first.\n595-\n596:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Arrival time (earliest)\n597:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n598-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various arrival times\n599-- **Action**: User selects \"Arrival time (earliest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n600-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the earliest arrival first.\n601-\n602:#### Test: FilterSidebar combining multiple filters\n603:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n604-- **Initial state**: Results page with diverse flights\n605-- **Action**: User checks \"Nonstop\" in Stops, selects \"Delta\" in Airlines, and sets max price to $500\n606-- **Expected**: Only nonstop Delta flights priced at $500 or below are shown. All three filters are applied simultaneously.\n607-\n608:#### Test: FilterSidebar filters can be used repeatedly\n609:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n610-- **Initial state**: Results page with no filters\n611-- **Action**: User checks \"Nonstop\", observes filtered results, then unchecks \"Nonstop\" and checks \"1 stop\", then changes sort to \"Price (lowest)\"\n612-- **Expected**: Each filter change updates results correctly. The filters work properly on repeated use.\n613-\n614-### FlightResultCard\n615-\n616-#### Test: FlightResultCard displays airline info\n617-- **Components**: FlightResultCard\n618-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded with flights\n619-- **Action**: User observes a flight result card\n--\n765:- **Components**: Pagination, FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n766-- **Initial state**: Results page with \"Nonstop\" filter active, showing filtered results\n767-- **Action**: User clicks \"Load more results\"\n768-- **Expected**: The newly loaded results also respect the active filters. Only nonstop flights are appended.\n769-\n770-#### Test: Pagination can be used repeatedly\n771-- **Components**: Pagination, FlightResultCard\n772-- **Initial state**: Results page with many available results\n773-- **Action**: User clicks \"Load more\" three times in sequence\n774-- **Expected**: Each click appends more results. Results accumulate correctly without duplicates. The button disappears when no more results remain.\n775-"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0234547c-0c1f-4430-8e8a-3c47a9bac0f9","uuid":"c84c5e74-6fc0-4634-a5b0-495bed24b5dd","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"419:- FilterSidebar\n420-- FlightResultCard\n421-- TrackPricesToggle\n422-- Pagination\n423-\n424-### SearchSummaryBar\n425-\n426-#### Test: SearchSummaryBar displays search parameters after search\n427-- **Components**: SearchSummaryBar\n428-- **Initial state**: User searched LAX → JFK, Mar 25 – Apr 1, 1 adult, Economy, Round trip\n429-- **Action**: User observes the summary bar at the top of the results page\n--\n480:### FilterSidebar\n481-\n482:#### Test: FilterSidebar displays all filter sections\n483:- **Components**: FilterSidebar\n484-- **Initial state**: Search results page loaded with results\n485-- **Action**: User observes the left sidebar\n486-- **Expected**: The sidebar displays filter sections: Stops, Airlines, Price range, Duration range, Departure time, and a Sort by dropdown. All sections are visible and labeled.\n487-\n488:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — check Nonstop\n489:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n490-- **Initial state**: Results page with mix of nonstop and connecting flights\n491-- **Action**: User checks the \"Nonstop\" checkbox in the Stops filter\n492-- **Expected**: Only nonstop flights are displayed in the results list. Flights with 1+ stops are hidden.\n493-\n494:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — check 1 stop\n495:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n496-- **Initial state**: Results page with mix of nonstop and connecting flights, no filters applied\n497-- **Action**: User checks the \"1 stop\" checkbox\n498-- **Expected**: Only 1-stop flights are displayed. Nonstop and 2+ stop flights are hidden.\n499-\n500:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — check multiple options\n501:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n502-- **Initial state**: Results page with various flights\n503-- **Action**: User checks both \"Nonstop\" and \"1 stop\" checkboxes\n504-- **Expected**: Both nonstop and 1-stop flights are displayed. Only 2+ stop flights are hidden.\n505-\n506:#### Test: FilterSidebar stops filter — uncheck to remove filter\n507:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n508-- **Initial state**: \"Nonstop\" checkbox is checked, only nonstop flights shown\n509-- **Action**: User unchecks \"Nonstop\"\n510-- **Expected**: All flights are displayed again (no stops filter active).\n511-\n512:#### Test: FilterSidebar airlines filter shows airlines with flight counts\n513:- **Components**: FilterSidebar\n514-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded with results from multiple airlines\n515-- **Action**: User observes the Airlines filter section\n516-- **Expected**: A list of airline names is shown, each with a checkbox and a count of how many flights that airline has in the results (e.g., \"Delta (12)\", \"United (8)\").\n517-\n518:#### Test: FilterSidebar airlines filter — select specific airline\n519:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n520-- **Initial state**: Results with flights from Delta, United, and American\n521-- **Action**: User checks the \"Delta\" checkbox in the Airlines filter\n522-- **Expected**: Only Delta flights are shown in results. United and American flights are hidden.\n523-\n524:#### Test: FilterSidebar airlines filter — select multiple airlines\n525:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n526-- **Initial state**: Results with flights from multiple airlines\n527-- **Action**: User checks \"Delta\" and \"United\"\n528-- **Expected**: Only Delta and United flights are shown. Other airline flights are hidden.\n529-\n530:#### Test: FilterSidebar price range slider displays histogram\n531:- **Components**: FilterSidebar\n532-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded\n533-- **Action**: User observes the Price range filter section\n534-- **Expected**: A price range slider is displayed with min and max handles. Above or within the slider, a histogram shows the distribution of prices across the results. The min and max price labels are shown.\n535-\n536:#### Test: FilterSidebar price range slider filters results\n537:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n538-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights ranging from $150 to $800\n539-- **Action**: User drags the max price handle to $400\n540-- **Expected**: Only flights priced at $400 or below are displayed. Flights above $400 are hidden. The slider shows the updated max value.\n541-\n542:#### Test: FilterSidebar price range slider — adjust min price\n543:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n544-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights ranging from $150 to $800\n545-- **Action**: User drags the min price handle to $300\n546-- **Expected**: Only flights priced at $300 or above are displayed. Flights below $300 are hidden.\n547-\n548:#### Test: FilterSidebar duration range slider filters results\n549:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n550-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights of various durations\n551-- **Action**: User adjusts the duration slider to max 6 hours\n552-- **Expected**: Only flights with duration of 6 hours or less are displayed. Longer flights are hidden.\n553-\n554:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — Morning checkbox\n555:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n556-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various times\n557-- **Action**: User checks \"Morning\" in the Departure time filter\n558-- **Expected**: Only flights departing in the morning time window are displayed.\n559-\n560:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — multiple time periods\n561:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n562-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various times\n563-- **Action**: User checks \"Morning\" and \"Evening\"\n564-- **Expected**: Flights departing in either morning or evening time windows are displayed. Afternoon and night flights are hidden.\n565-\n566:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — arrival time checkboxes\n567:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n568-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded\n569-- **Action**: User checks \"Afternoon\" in the arrival time checkbox group\n570-- **Expected**: Only flights arriving in the afternoon are displayed.\n571-\n572:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by dropdown — default \"Best\"\n573:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n574-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded, no sort selection made\n575-- **Action**: User observes the Sort by dropdown\n576-- **Expected**: The dropdown shows \"Best\" as the default selected sort option.\n577-\n578:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Price (lowest)\n579:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n580-- **Initial state**: Results page with multiple flights at different prices\n581-- **Action**: User selects \"Price (lowest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n582-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the cheapest flight first. Prices increase going down the list.\n583-\n584:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Duration (shortest)\n585:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n586-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights of various durations\n587-- **Action**: User selects \"Duration (shortest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n588-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the shortest flight first. Durations increase going down the list.\n589-\n590:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Departure time (earliest)\n591:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n592-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various departure times\n593-- **Action**: User selects \"Departure time (earliest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n594-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the earliest departure first.\n595-\n596:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Arrival time (earliest)\n597:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n598-- **Initial state**: Results page with flights at various arrival times\n599-- **Action**: User selects \"Arrival time (earliest)\" from the Sort by dropdown\n600-- **Expected**: Results are reordered with the earliest arrival first.\n601-\n602:#### Test: FilterSidebar combining multiple filters\n603:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n604-- **Initial state**: Results page with diverse flights\n605-- **Action**: User checks \"Nonstop\" in Stops, selects \"Delta\" in Airlines, and sets max price to $500\n606-- **Expected**: Only nonstop Delta flights priced at $500 or below are shown. All three filters are applied simultaneously.\n607-\n608:#### Test: FilterSidebar filters can be used repeatedly\n609:- **Components**: FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n610-- **Initial state**: Results page with no filters\n611-- **Action**: User checks \"Nonstop\", observes filtered results, then unchecks \"Nonstop\" and checks \"1 stop\", then changes sort to \"Price (lowest)\"\n612-- **Expected**: Each filter change updates results correctly. The filters work properly on repeated use.\n613-\n614-### FlightResultCard\n615-\n616-#### Test: FlightResultCard displays airline info\n617-- **Components**: FlightResultCard\n618-- **Initial state**: Results page loaded with flights\n619-- **Action**: User observes a flight result card\n--\n765:- **Components**: Pagination, FilterSidebar, FlightResultCard\n766-- **Initial state**: Results page with \"Nonstop\" filter active, showing filtered results\n767-- **Action**: User clicks \"Load more results\"\n768-- **Expected**: The newly loaded results also respect the active filters. Only nonstop flights are appended.\n769-\n770-#### Test: Pagination can be used repeatedly\n771-- **Components**: Pagination, FlightResultCard\n772-- **Initial state**: Results page with many available results\n773-- **Action**: User clicks \"Load more\" three times in sequence\n774-- **Expected**: Each click appends more results. Results accumulate correctly without duplicates. The button disappears when no more results remain.\n775-","numLines":164}}
